14:Definition OriginalReplay:Prop:=forall m og ig ob ib os is0 ol il,
15- Inputs m og ig(Ptrofs.repr 4)Ptrofs.zero trace_input->
16- Inputs m ob ib Ptrofs.zero Ptrofs.zero base2->
17- Inputs m os is0 Ptrofs.zero Ptrofs.zero small2->
18- Inputs m ol il Ptrofs.zero Ptrofs.zero large2->Separate og ig ob ib os is0 ol il->
19- exists ma mb mc md,
20- NormalCall m og ig(Ptrofs.repr 4)Ptrofs.zero trace_input ma/\Post m ma og ig(Ptrofs.repr 4)Ptrofs.zero trace_input/\
21- NormalCall ma ob ib Ptrofs.zero Ptrofs.zero base2 mb/\Post ma mb ob ib Ptrofs.zero Ptrofs.zero base2/\
22- NormalCall mb os is0 Ptrofs.zero Ptrofs.zero small2 mc/\Post mb mc os is0 Ptrofs.zero Ptrofs.zero small2/\
23- NormalCall mc ol il Ptrofs.zero Ptrofs.zero large2 md/\Post mc md ol il Ptrofs.zero Ptrofs.zero large2.
24:Theorem original_trace_four_calls:OriginalReplay.
25-Proof. intros m og ig ob ib os is0 ol il IG IB IS IL SEP;destruct SEP.
26- destruct(call_summary m og ig(Ptrofs.repr 4)Ptrofs.zero trace_input IG)as[ma[PG[QG OTHERG]]].
27- assert(IBA:Inputs ma ob ib Ptrofs.zero Ptrofs.zero base2)by(eapply post_preserves_other_inputs;eauto).
28- assert(ISA:Inputs ma os is0 Ptrofs.zero Ptrofs.zero small2)by(eapply post_preserves_other_inputs;eauto).
29- assert(ILA:Inputs ma ol il Ptrofs.zero Ptrofs.zero large2)by(eapply post_preserves_other_inputs;eauto).
30- destruct(call_summary ma ob ib Ptrofs.zero Ptrofs.zero base2 IBA)as[mb[PB[QB OTHERB]]].
31- assert(ISB:Inputs mb os is0 Ptrofs.zero Ptrofs.zero small2)by(eapply post_preserves_other_inputs;eauto).
32- assert(ILB:Inputs mb ol il Ptrofs.zero Ptrofs.zero large2)by(eapply post_preserves_other_inputs;eauto).
33- destruct(call_summary mb os is0 Ptrofs.zero Ptrofs.zero small2 ISB)as[mc[PS[QS OTHERS]]].
34- assert(ILC:Inputs mc ol il Ptrofs.zero Ptrofs.zero large2)by(eapply post_preserves_other_inputs;eauto).
35- destruct(call_summary mc ol il Ptrofs.zero Ptrofs.zero large2 ILC)as[md[PL[QL OTHERL]]].
36- exists ma,mb,mc,md;unfold NormalCall;split;[exact PG|];split;[exact QG|];split;[exact PB|];split;[exact QB|];split;[exact PS|];split;[exact QS|];split;[exact PL|exact QL].
37-Qed.
38-Theorem original_trace_statuses:Result trace_input=Vint Int.zero/\Result base2=Vint Int.zero/\Result small2=Vint Int.one/\Result large2=Vint Int.zero.
39-Proof. split;[exact(proj1 original_arbitrary_trace_kernel)|];split;[exact(proj1 base2_kernel)|];split;[exact(proj1 small2_kernel)|exact(proj1 large2_kernel)]. Qed.
40:Theorem original_trace_scale_failure:OriginalReplay /\ Result base2<>Result small2.
41-Proof. split;[exact original_trace_four_calls|exact RefuteScaleStatus2]. Qed.
42:Theorem original_trace_residual_failure:OriginalReplay /\ Result large2=Vint Int.zero /\ SmallResidual(residual2 large2)=false /\ Float32.to_bits(residual2 large2)=Int.repr 3212836864.
43-Proof. split;[exact original_trace_four_calls|];destruct RefuteLargeResidual2 as[RET BAD];split;[exact RET|];split;[exact BAD|exact large2_residual]. Qed.
